<title>INDIA: Delhi stocks close lower on political tensions.</title>
<headline>Delhi stocks close lower on political tensions.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delhi shares closed sharply lower on political tensions after a special court issued summons to former prime minister P.V. Narasimha Rao to appear personally in a court case, brokers said.</p>
<p>The indicative Delhi Stock Exchange index closed 13.77 points lower at 713.76 points.</p>
</text>
